     3636         (gds-list.prod-type + " " + string (gds-list.prod-code, ">>>>>>>>>9") ) column-label "Производитель" format "x(9)"
     3637         WITH SIZE 74 BY 16 separators.
     3638   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3639       dsp-rs  AT ROW 1 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     3640       b-help  AT ROW 1 COL 61
     3641       br-option AT ROW 2 COL 75
     3642       b-exit  AT ROW 2 COL 1
